 "intro": {
  "@es": "El chino se escribe con caracteres. Aquí verás espacios entre palabras para que puedas identificarlas; en la escritura normal del chino no se separan así. El pinyin ayuda a pronunciar y las marcas muestran tonos, no tildes españolas.",
  "@en": "The Chinese is written with characters. Here you will see spaces between words so that you can identify them; in the normal writing of the Chinese they do not separate like this. The pinyin helps to pronounce and the brands show Spanish tones, not Spanish tides."
 }
